flowchart LR
  C[Customer browser/device\nKeeps original] -->|HTTPS file + policy| API[Amazon API Gateway\nHTTP API]
  API -->|Invoke| L[AWS Lambda\nFastAPI direct route\nIn-memory processing]
  L -->|Only for scanned images/PDFs| T[Amazon Textract\nOCR]
  T -->|Text + geometry| L
  L -->|Protected bytes + content-free receipt| API
  API -->|Direct download| C
  L -. UTC day + aggregate count + expiry .-> D[Amazon DynamoDB\nQuota only]
  L -. Logs / metrics .-> CW[Amazon CloudWatch]
  CW -. Alarm actions .-> SNS[Amazon SNS\nSubscription required]
  CF[AWS CloudFormation] -. Provisions .-> API
  IAM[AWS IAM LabRole] -. Permissions .-> L
  subgraph LEGACY[Legacy workflow, inactive for public route]
    S3R[S3 raw] --> EB[EventBridge] --> CL[Classifier Lambda] --> S3P[S3 protected]
    CL --> GOV[DynamoDB governance records]
    EB -. Failure .-> DLQ[SQS DLQ]
  end
